{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39761","headline":"河南府试秋夕闻新鴈 · 黄滔","name":"河南府试秋夕闻新鴈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘南飞去日，蓟北乍惊秋。\n呌出陇云夜，闻爲客子愁。\n一声初触梦，半白已侵头。\n旅馆移欹枕，江城起倚楼。\n余灯依古壁，片月下沧洲。\n寂听良宵彻，踌躇感岁流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39761.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39761","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}